    ("Opaque token", "The name is a session-derived token with no dictionary meaning; surface reading cannot recover its intended referent."),
    ("Cluster anchoring", "Sibling links to consciousness pages such as the analysis and inquiry threads indicate the topic area the label belongs to."),
